OL,3,GNEWSAParents call for return of
OL,4,Adedicated school bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents living in rural Oxfordshire are
OL,7,Fcalling for the return of a council-run
OL,8,Fschool bus service, claiming the
OL,9,Fcurrent public services are making
OL,10,Ftheir children late for school.
OL,12,FThe county council arranges
OL,13,Fhome-to-school transport, but can
OL,14,Fcontract the service out if a private
OL,15,Foperator is running a bus on the route
OL,16,Fat the same time. Some public services
OL,17,Fin rural areas include longer routes
OL,18,Fand more stops.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
