OL,3,GNEWSAParents call for return of
OL,4,Adedicated school bus
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies living in south Oxfordshire
OL,7,Fand Cherwell have reported problems
OL,8,Fwith public buses, including a lack of
OL,9,Favailable seats and regular delays.
OL,11,FA local authority spokesperson said the
OL,12,Fcouncil "takes seriously any concerns
OL,13,Frelating to safety, safeguarding,
OL,14,Faccessibility or reliability".
